>speech_prog buy sell list value shop wares gear equipment~
if rand(13)
mpecho $I says 'Type list before you drool on the counter.'
else
if rand(14)
mpecho $I says 'Gear helps your body. Training makes you dangerous. Coin helps me. Mostly the last one.'
else
if rand(17)
mpecho $I says 'If it says strength or wisdom on the tag, ask an immortal whether the world has caught up yet.'
else
if rand(20)
mpecho $I says 'I buy cheap and sell honest. The honest part is the one that hurts.'
else
if rand(25)
mpecho $I says 'No, I will not haggle. Yes, I will watch you try. It's the highlight of my day.'
else
if rand(33)
mpecho $I says 'Browsing is free. Touching is a deposit. Bleeding on the merchandise is a purchase.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I says 'Everything here has killed at least one previous owner. Adds character, I find.'
else
mpecho $I eyes your inventory the way a vulture eyes a slow horse.
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
~
