wall~
Special thanks to Alathon - Implementor

Thanks to Dekkum for his unending loyalty to the standards of
Clan Renegade and Static Chaos. Through hard times you were the
wing man -- thank you for all your support.

Thanks to Skyler for his dedication and hard work ... and the
complete reformation of Clan Renegade's entirety.

Thanks to Orez for his dedication and insistance of pushing all
aspects of the clan further.

Thanks to Malucifer and Co. for founding the clan, and giving me
reason to keep it running.

For their support, Jinx, Blah, Leaf and Shintoryu - Thanks for leaving.

Thanks to Shinku, the true Mihari of Clan Renegades, whose leadership
and guidance brought the team and family that the brotherhood is today.
The honor of Renegades lies in you.
~
